        "raw": "[quote=\"Rabk\"]\n\nNot really a baseball fan, but that update was enough to sucker me in. Can&#39;t resist more Sentinels stuff.\n\n[/quote]\n\nThe game is a lot of fun even if you know nothing about baseball. I played with a guy from Australia at PAX East who had no clue what baseball was and had a great time. Played it at the bar too right on the counter which was awesome. I don&#39;t have many games that can &quot;travel&quot; like that.\n",
